  "title": "xml: Preload default media types",
  "description": "It is faster to insert the default media types into the map and\nhave them be replaced if a particular DTD overrides them than to\ncheck if the type has already been placed in the map by a DTD and\ninsert them only if not.\n\nThe latter performs a moderately expensive string hash twice on all\nthe media types. Replacing the same key in the hash table with a new\nvalue should occur only rarely, and even if it does it's faster than\nhashing twice.",
